This Monster Ring patch is a further developed version of Arthur J.
O'Dwyer's Monster Ring patch, in which I've made:

* Monsters can wear a ring on each hand.
* Monsters can now wear and benefit from rings of see invisible,
teleport control, increase accuracy and increase damage.
* Monsters can now gain these attributes from held artifacts as well.
In this case, it's mostly just the Master Key of Thievery conferring
teleport control. (Implementing half spell/magic damage for monsters is
intended in the future...)
* Player-monsters can now be generated with rings.
* I fixed up a few inconsistencies (especially related to monster
teleport control), did some other stuff which I can't remember, and,
um, simplified the code, making it easier for more rings to be
implemented.

<< http://www.greyfire.org/~l/monring.diff >>

